"versão (`1b71f243733 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1b71f243733>`__, `dc13c23ed81 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/dc13c23ed81>`__, `a7debafdafa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a7debafdafa>`__, `173a57422f7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/173a57422f7>`__)."

